       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. E14.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-REF-VAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 10.
       01 WS-CONTENT-VAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 20.
       01 WS-VALUE-VAL USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 30.
       01 WS-TABLE.
           05 WS-ITEM OCCURS 3 TIMES PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 111 TO WS-ITEM(1).
           MOVE 222 TO WS-ITEM(2).
           MOVE 333 TO WS-ITEM(3).
           CALL "E14SUB" USING
               BY REFERENCE WS-REF-VAL
               BY CONTENT WS-CONTENT-VAL
               BY VALUE WS-VALUE-VAL
               BY REFERENCE WS-TABLE.
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL REF=" WS-REF-VAL.
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL CONTENT=" WS-CONTENT-VAL.
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL VALUE=" WS-VALUE-VAL.
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL T1=" WS-ITEM(1).
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL T2=" WS-ITEM(2).
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL T3=" WS-ITEM(3).
           STOP RUN.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. E14SUB.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-REF PIC 9(4).
       01 LK-CONTENT PIC 9(4).
       01 LK-VALUE USAGE BINARY-LONG.
       01 LK-TABLE.
           05 LK-ITEM OCCURS 3 TIMES PIC 9(3).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-REF LK-CONTENT BY VALUE LK-VALUE
               LK-TABLE.
       SUB-PARA.
           ADD 1 TO LK-REF.
           ADD 1 TO LK-CONTENT.
           ADD 1 TO LK-VALUE.
           ADD 1 TO LK-ITEM(1).
           ADD 1 TO LK-ITEM(2).
           ADD 1 TO LK-ITEM(3).
           DISPLAY "SUB SEES REF=" LK-REF " CONTENT=" LK-CONTENT
               " VALUE=" LK-VALUE.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM E14SUB.
       END PROGRAM E14.
